[IBIS ver]       3.2
[File name]      vsc7442_v0_1.ibs
[File Rev]       0.1
[Date]           Jun 04, 2014
[Source]         From silicon level SPICE model.
[Notes]          This IBIS file contains IBIS models for the VSC7442.

                 The C_COMP values are estimated.
                 The R_pin, C_Pin and L_pin values for 10G and 6G serdes 
                 (S13-S36) are extracted at 3125MHz. 2G5 and 1G serdes 
                 (S0-S12) and DDR are extracted at 625MHz. All other signals 
                 are extracted at 100MHz.
                 The component model does NOT include any package parasitics.

                 10G and 6G serdes models are only valid for 1Gb operation, 
                 for higher speeds the AMS model kit must be used instead. 

                 The file name is longer than the designated 12 chars.
                 Currently ignored.

                 Version Log

                   0.1  Jun 04, 2014    Preliminary release


